# High-volume local benchmark telemetry.
# direct-saturation-<rate>.json holds full per-repeat sample series,
# injector-<rate>-<repeat>.json holds full per-event injector output, and
# postgres-diagnostics-raw-<label>.json holds full per-tick pg_stat_activity/
# pg_locks sample series - from scripts/benchmark/direct_saturation.py,
# direct_injector.py, and postgres_diagnostics.py respectively. All three
# are useful locally for analysis but make commits/history unnecessarily
# large. Compact evidence (README rows, postgres-diagnostics-summary-*.json,
# EXPLAIN output, migration artifacts) stays tracked - only these raw
# telemetry filenames are excluded.
artifacts/benchmark/**/direct-saturation.json
artifacts/benchmark/**/direct-saturation-*.json
artifacts/benchmark/**/injector-*.json
artifacts/benchmark/**/postgres-diagnostics-raw-*.json
